I need to learn about some of the lower levels of how Linux works on the Alpha.
Specifically, I need to know some basic Alpha assembly and how Linux/Alpha
handles calling conventions (i.e. are parameters passed on the stack or in
registers, etc.)  I need to know what happens at the assembly level when a
program makes a function call on the Alpha.


