>>> Paul Jakma said:
> Is there a flash management utility for ruffian?
> 
> I tried the pc164lx fmu.gz, but when i ran it, it exited back to milo
> straight away. I looked on gatekeeper and couldn't find any fmu.gz
> specific to ruffian.

That's because there's never (to the best of my knowledge) ever been one.

RUFFIAN is not a DEC, er COMPAQ, motherboard, and so the appropriate level of
docs were not (originally) available with the details for FLASH management.
Now, we prefer folk not to FLASH MILO, so there's been no effort made on it.

If you have the appropriate docs, *and* the courage, have a go... ;-}

