The Digital UNIX libraries contain code licensed from others.
We can't just package them up and give them away.

As the Digital compilers are ported to Linux to run native, they will
use the linux libraries (and/or the math libraries that are entirely
Digital developed: e.g. the portable math library recently made
available;) ergo this problem won't exist.  Coming soon
to systems near you.
